WEBVTT

NOTE Version 5 selected-voice illustrated walkthrough; timed to its matching v5 MP4, not the legacy v4 recording.

bursar-001
00:00:00.286 --> 00:00:05.491
Welcome, Bursar, your school’s short link
opens its own crest, motto and colours,

bursar-002
00:00:05.491 --> 00:00:08.704
with private finance records hidden until
sign-in.

bursar-003
00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:13.469
Use your registered phone number and
four-digit PIN, without email or a

bursar-004
00:00:13.469 --> 00:00:16.473
password, to enter your authorised bursar
workspace.

bursar-005
00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:22.499
Install school app adds your school’s
crest and name, or use Safari, Share, Add

bursar-006
00:00:22.499 --> 00:00:25.849
to Home Screen on iPhone, and sign in
online first.

bursar-007
00:00:26.687 --> 00:00:31.174
Check the correct session, term, fee
schedule, sibling discounts and approved

bursar-008
00:00:31.174 --> 00:00:34.495
waivers before confirming each learner’s
invoice balance.

bursar-009
00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:39.990
Verify bank transfers before confirming
payments and issuing receipts, then review

bursar-010
00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:43.581
debtors, remembering online payments and
messages need internet.

bursar-011
00:00:44.481 --> 00:00:48.860
Payroll separates teaching staff from
nannies, security guards, cleaners,

bursar-012
00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:53.119
drivers and cooks on salary sheets,
without unnecessary teacher logins.

bursar-013
00:00:54.029 --> 00:00:57.806
Teachers and Mu’allims can draft
attendance, scores and memorization

bursar-014
00:00:57.806 --> 00:01:00.250
offline and sync automatically on
reconnect,

bursar-015
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:02.639
but bank checks still require
connectivity.

bursar-016
00:01:03.668 --> 00:01:08.766
Before exporting payroll or receipts,
check the school, period, staff category

bursar-017
00:01:08.766 --> 00:01:13.080
and saved status, keeping salaries, bank
details and PINs private.
